      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amesbury%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Robert Frost, the Pulitzer‑winning poet, spent time in Amesbury and is buried in the town.",
