      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amesbury%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Al Capp, the cartoonist behind the long‑running strip Li’l Abner, lived most of his life in Amesbury and is interred there.",
